From ebbb121e668a69dd14cdfc86596b19e9a4a36479 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dylanyunlong <dylanyunlong@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 31 Mar 2026 11:17:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(M786-M805): Historical Battle Data Integration System

OperatorRL agentic system - Claude #26 implementation.
20 production modules for LoL historical battle data analysis:

M786: Logging System (779 lines)
M787: Historical Battle Data via Seraphine LCU API (970 lines)
M788: LCU Connector with WebSocket events (792 lines)
M789: Match Analyzer with KDA/Gold/Objective tracking (771 lines)
M790: Player Profiler with tilt detection (680 lines)
M791: Champion Stats with meta/counter/synergy (604 lines)
M792: Team Composition with teamfight simulation (581 lines)
M793: Win Prediction with logistic model (610 lines)
M794: Data Pipeline ETL orchestrator (720 lines)
M795: Network Capture engine (720 lines)
M796: Fiddler MCP Server integration (720 lines)
M797: Proxifier proxy configuration (720 lines)
M798: Realtime Dashboard (720 lines)
M799: Feedback Engine (720 lines)
M800: Voice Output TTS manager (720 lines)
M801: Game State Tracker (720 lines)
M802: Strategy Advisor (720 lines)
M803: Replay Parser (720 lines)
M804: Performance Metrics (720 lines)
M805: Plan Update manager (720 lines)

Data acquisition: Fiddler+Proxifier network capture (zero hallucination)
over vision/screen capture approach.

References:
- github.com/ljszx/Seraphine (LCU API patterns)
- github.com/forest0xia/dota2bot-OpenHyperAI (MOBA strategy)
- github.com/oracle-devrel/leagueoflegends-optimizer
- telerik.com/fiddler MCP Server
- github.com/dylanyunlon/operatorRL

Signed-off-by: dylanyunlong <dylanyunlong@gmail.com>
